{"id":"57ef15d90618ea60","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-solovay-model.md","title":"Solovay Model","display":"thm-solovay-model — Solovay Model","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-solovay-model","aliases":["58-thm-solovay-model","Solovay Model","Lebesgue Measurable Sets"],"display":"thm-solovay-model — Solovay Model","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","[[58-thm-dependent-choice]]","[[../batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-solovay-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-solovay-model</span><span>Solovay Model</span><span>Lebesgue Measurable Sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-model — Solovay Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81181b26f16ba65a\" href=\"?note=81181b26f16ba65a\" title=\"58-thm-dependent-choice\">58-thm-dependent-choice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8\" href=\"?note=3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md\">../batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{DC}\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{DC}\\in V\\)</span> are formal theories and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span> is their syntactic consistency predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\\!\\left(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\\!\\left(\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathrm{DC}+\\forall A\\in V\\;(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\\!\\left(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\\!\\left(\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathrm{DC}+\\forall A\\in V\\;(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Solovay: constructed model (1970).</li>\n<li>Shelah: showed inaccessible necessary.</li>\n<li>In the Solovay model, every set of reals is Lebesgue measurable and has the Baire property.</li>\n<li>DC preserved: analysis works.</li>\n<li>Applications: descriptive set theory.</li>\n<li>Contrast: Banach-Tarski requires AC.</li>\n<li>Solovay's construction takes place after a Lévy collapse and yields the displayed relative-consistency implication; an inaccessible cardinal in the current universe does not by itself place the Solovay model inside that same universe.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-dependent-choice","status":"resolved","id":"81181b26f16ba65a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-dependent-choice]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md","status":"resolved","id":"3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{DC}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S,\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}model} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\\!\\left(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\\!\\left(\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathrm{DC}+\\forall A\\in V\\;(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\to\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A))\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1554,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4426","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-solovay-model.md|58-thm-solovay-model]]（batch08）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-260","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection-proper.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection.md]]\n[[58-thm-coanalytic-separation.md]]\n[[58-thm-coding-universe.md]]\n[[58-thm-cofinality-regular.md]]\n[[58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH.md]]\n[[58-thm-collapse-forcing.md]]\n[[58-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[58-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[58-thm-countable-choice.md]]\n[[58-thm-covering-lemma.md]]\n[[58-thm-dense-set-lemma.md]]\n[[58-thm-dependent-choice.md]]\n[[58-thm-determinacy.md]]\n[[58-thm-diamond-implies-CH.md]]\n[[58-thm-diamond-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-easton-forcing.md]]\n[[58-thm-elementary-chain.md]]\n[[58-thm-epsilon-numbers.md]]\n[[58-thm-erdos-rado.md]]\n[[58-thm-extendible-cardinal.md]]\n[[58-thm-fine-structure.md]]\n[[58-thm-fixed-point-lemma.md]]\n[[58-thm-fodor.md]]\n[[58-thm-forcing-consistency-st